file crates/gui/src/views/left.rs
symbol paths_window
lines 0 88
hash fad58c8899b417c5
note Trigger and effect: the filter field sits in a toolbar above the list, beside the 'new path' button; its text is read while the list is built, so there is no filter action to apply. While it holds text the toolbar shows 'n of m' paths, and an empty result says 'no path name, step symbol or step file matches'. Under a path that is not the one being read, found_step_rows lists the steps the filter found. A non-empty filter forces every group open. The rows come from listed_rows instead of the whole map, and removed paths pass through lists, which reads names only.
